0.005010428571428571 :  CDC for GGDays: Decrease in canopy cover (in fraction per growing-degree day)
778 :  GDDays: building-up of Harvest Index during yield formation
100 :  dry matter content (%) of fresh yield
0.3 :  Minimum effective rooting depth (m) in first year - required only in case of regrowth
